			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750013201,
					"content": "居然真的成功了…这之前只是出现在「故事」中的场景，真是了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013202,
					"content": "原本聒噪不休的声音也安静了下去…「小缝影针」又回归了原本的样貌。那么大的东西，「轰隆」一下砸了下去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013203,
					"content": "呼…真的有人能做到…这不会是一场梦吧，你们都真实存在？不会是我的臆想吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013204,
					"content": "梦醒了…该你自己解决啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013205,
					"content": "别说这么残忍的话啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013206,
					"content": "#怎么样，我就说，{NICKNAME}是很强的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013207,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013208,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也觉得很了不起吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013209,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，了不起的异邦勇士啊，你可没有被深渊影响到吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013210,
						750013211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013210,
					"content": "没事，区区深渊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013212,
					"content": "#就连部族里最强的勇士面对深渊都得打起十二分精神，{NICKNAME}果然不是一般人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013213,
					"content": "哎呀，说不定以这个题材写出的故事，能够比桑哈杰记录的故事更加精彩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013214,
					"content": "啊嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013215,
					"content": "虽然不知道桑哈杰是谁，但是听上去很了不起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013216,
					"content": "哈哈，对于所有「讲故事的部族人」来说，烟谜主的桑哈杰都是值得崇敬的人物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013217,
					"content": "不过现在情况紧急，等有空的时候，再和你们说桑哈杰的故事吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013218,
					"content": "好了，我们到下一根浮起的「小缝影针」那边去吧，快些解决问题，我今晚就能开始动笔啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013219,
					"content": "出发出发！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013220,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013211,
					"content": "暂时还挺健康的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013212
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7505704,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7505702
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7505702",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7505702,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7500107",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7500107,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750010801,
					"content": "哇，刚才听到了些可怕的动静，所以想过来看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010802,
					"content": "过来的时候还安慰自己「别乱想啦，蒂图，还能有什么事呢」，结果根本就发生了了不起的大事啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010803,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010804,
					"content": "这里居然还有一只小嵴锋龙…是你把这两位异邦人引到这里来的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010805,
					"content": "以及，这个「缝影针」…是你们钻下去的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010806,
						750010809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010806,
					"content": "…难道，不应该被钻下去？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010807
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010807,
					"content": "#啊？那，{NICKNAME}，我们岂不是做了很糟糕的事…不如趁目击者只有一位…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010808,
					"content": "#哈哈，别说那么恐怖的话啦，情况没那么严重，不如说你们做了好事？这位{M#兄弟}{F#小姐}是{NICKNAME}，你呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010813,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010814,
					"content": "#这是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010815,
					"content": "嗯，而我的名字是蒂图，我是部族里负责讲故{RUBY#[D]叙事人}事的人。同时，也负责「照看」山谷里的这几条石柱子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010816,
					"content": "当然了，你们钻下去的这块石柱，是三根「小缝影针」其中之一，也在我的看管范围之内。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010817,
					"content": "看、看管…果然，我们把那个什么石柱子弄掉了，纳塔本地人就会以此来向我们索要赔偿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010818,
					"content": "呜，早知道刚才就不应该报真名的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010819,
					"content": "赔偿…「蒂图灵光一闪，说不定能够以这样的方式要挟眼前的人达成自己的目的…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010820,
					"content": "感觉如果是这样的情节的话，就该插入这样的叙事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010821,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010822,
					"content": "啊，抱歉，光顾着想些故事的事。我是部族里负责讲故{RUBY#[D]叙事人}事的人，讲了许多年的故事，最近到了需要自己想故事的时候了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010823,
					"content": "这几天一直在为此烦心，结果「缝影针」也出了问题…老话说得好啊，人倒霉的时候龙也跟着一起倒霉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010824,
					"content": "咳咳，我是不会要挟你们的啦，毕竟如果我真的想要要挟你们，就、就不会把脑海里的句子说出口了不是吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010825,
					"content": "哎呀，你看，我们互相报上了名字，却又没有大打出手，这就说明我们已经是朋友啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010826,
					"content": "不知道你们能不能听听朋友我这边的请求啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010827,
					"content": "只要…不是索要赔偿的话？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010828
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010828,
					"content": "当然不是啦，该怎么说好呢，对了，你们在山谷里漫步的时候，有没有看到一块超级大，还刻有金色花纹的固态燃素块…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010829,
					"content": "就在这片区域的中心，应该很显眼哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010830,
						750010831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010830,
					"content": "好像有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010833
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010833,
					"content": "我要说的其实就和那个大石柱子有关…那个大石柱子被部族的人们称为「缝影针」，只不过，最近出了一些问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010834,
					"content": "在看到你们之前，我都想放弃了，甚至都对自己说，「写一个『缝影针』问题解决不了，灾难毁灭了部族的故事也行啊…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010835,
					"content": "等等，只是一个石柱子，和毁灭部族有什么关系…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010836,
					"content": "而且你刚才一直在说的「缝影针」，和更刚才说的，我们钻下去的什么「小缝影针」，明明都是大石柱子，为什么叫这个呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010837,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010838,
					"content": "#哦，{NICKNAME}和派蒙都是异邦人，确实得解释得更详细一些。这其实和部族里的一个传说故事有关。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010839,
					"content": "故事里说，大灵将「缝影针」悬挂于此，是为了缝住火山大王的影子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010840,
					"content": "不过真实的历史是这样的，那柱子之下的其实是被封印在此的深渊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010841,
					"content": "在纳塔，故事大多都是这样，是为了警告，是被叙事装点过的话语，所有的修辞都是一种譬喻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010842,
					"content": "等等，所以下面的其实是被封印起来的深渊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010843,
					"content": "是啊，最近三根小的「缝影针」中浮起了两根，说不定等第三根浮起来的时候，底下的坏东西就会跟潮水一样涌出来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010844,
					"content": "所以看到你们钻下去了一根，实在是有点喜出望外，所以当然了，也不可能向你们要赔偿啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010845,
					"content": "而且，我想向你们请求，能不能把另外一根「小缝影针」也按下去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010846,
					"content": "#唔…怎么办好呢，{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010847,
						750010848
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010847,
					"content": "…事涉深渊，很难袖手旁观了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010849
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010849,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010850
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010850,
					"content": "#好吧，既然连{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}都答应了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010851
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010851,
					"content": "哎呀…就像黑暗蒙昧之时总有火光出现，呵呵，危难之际也总能傲立起了不得的豪杰。人类的可能性总在这时候变得相当耀眼啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010852
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010852,
					"content": "#说不定这也能是个了不起的好故事，{NICKNAME}，你拥有一些故事里的英雄也不具备的气质呢，真让人期待。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010853
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010853,
					"content": "走吧，英雄们，我们这就出发，去看看剩下那根浮起来的「缝影针」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010848,
					"content": "或许我们可以帮上一点忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010849
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010831,
					"content": "没有什么印象了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010832
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010832,
					"content": "是嘛，那个大家伙明明挺显眼的，不过没关系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010809,
					"content": "是派蒙干的，我只是从犯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750010810,
					"content": "哇，这种时候你总是这样，我也是会生气的哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010811,
					"content": "#哈哈，不用那么紧张，不如说，真是让人松了口气。这位小小的女士叫派蒙，那这位{M#兄弟}{F#小姐}的名字呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂图"
				},
				{
					"id": 750010812,
					"content": "#我叫{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750010813
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}